From b81495995bad7e1c17cbf7ce7b51d7f22a9808ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Amicabile <diego.amicabile@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 07:02:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Borg: count warriors' Resist Poison potions from zero

In borg_power_inventory(), 'Reward Resistance Potions for Warriors'
resets k before the Resist Heat and Resist Cold loops but not before the
Resist Poison loop, which therefore starts at the Resist Cold count
(capped at 4).  A warrior carrying four Resist Cold potions put no
warrior value on its Resist Poison potions.

Reset k before the poison loop, as before the other two.

Tracked as diegoami/neo-angband-tracker#185.

(cherry picked from commit c056daabf55e6a1713e68381ef4a72ec6fd349b9)
---
 src/borg/borg-power.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/borg/borg-power.c b/src/borg/borg-power.c
index 277c3bccc..ab50c7a12 100644
--- a/src/borg/borg-power.c
+++ b/src/borg/borg-power.c
@@ -1210,6 +1210,7 @@ static int32_t borg_power_inventory(void)
                 for (; k < 4 && k < borg.trait[BI_ARESCOLD]; k++)
                     value += 500L;
             }
+            k = 0;
             /* collect pots if not immune */
             if (!borg.trait[BI_IPOIS]) {
                 for (; k < 4 && k < borg.trait[BI_ARESPOIS]; k++)
-- 
2.53.0

